OL,3,GNEWSAA34 south shut Highclere-A303
OL,4,Aafter vehicle fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the A34 southbound is shut
OL,7,Ffor repairs following a vehicle fire.
OL,9,FThe road is closed between the A343 at
OL,10,FHighclere and Wash Common and the A303
OL,11,Fat Bullington following the fire on
OL,12,FMonday night.
OL,14,FNational Highways said resurfacing work
OL,15,Fwas under way and the closure was
OL,16,Flikely to remain in place through the
OL,17,Fmorning rush hour.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
