OL,3,GNEWSAA34 south shut Highclere-A303
OL,4,Aafter vehicle fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic is being diverted off the A34
OL,7,Fat the Andover Road Interchange and on
OL,8,Fto the A343 towards Andover. Drivers
OL,9,Fare being urged to allow extra time for
OL,10,Ftheir journey.
